    Section(
      title: 'DOMAIN B: PROBLEM SOLVING',
      content:
          'You are evaluating this patient\'s central post-stroke pain (CPSP) syndrome. Describe the pathophysiology, diagnostic criteria, and how to differentiate thalamic pain from other post-stroke pain etiologies.',
